ub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98350#issuecomment-2424738168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98350","id":2424738168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QhpF4","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-20T08:43:53Z","updated_at":"2024-10-20T08:43:53Z","body":"Now, Current_directory (initial directory) is also supported. It should be an external storage directory, users can use `OS.get_system_dir(OS.SYSTEM_DIR_DESKTOP)` to get root path.\r\nexample:\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _show_native_file_picker() -> void:\r\n\tvar filters = PackedStringArray([\"image/*\",\"text/plain\",\"application/pdf\"])\r\n\tvar current_directory = OS.get_system_dir(OS.SYSTEM_DIR_DOCUMENTS)\r\n\tDisplayServer.file_dialog_show(\"title\", current_directory, \"filename\", false, DisplayServer.FILE_DIALOG_MODE_OPEN_FILE, filters, _picker_callback)\r\n\r\nfunc _picker_callback(status: bool, selected_paths: PackedStringArray, selected_filter_index: int):\r\n\t$Label.text += str(\"Status: \",status,\"\\n\")\r\n\t$Label.text += str(\"Selected Paths: \",selected_paths,\"\\n\\n\")\r\n\r\n``` ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2424738168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2424865658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98350#issuecomment-2424865658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98350","id":2424865658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QiIN6","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-20T11:31:28Z","updated_at":"2024-10-20T11:31:28Z","body":"_This is now ready for review, and all features are functioning as expected in my tests._\r\n\r\nRegarding the two unchecked tasks:\r\n- I considered implementing the `selected_filter_index` callback for single file selection, but it won't be feasible for multi-select scenarios. Therefore, I decided to omit this feature entirely.\r\n- As for supporting `RESOURCES` and `USERDATA` access modes, this is not possible with the android native file picker.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if any additional adjustments are needed!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2424865658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2424899461","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98350#issuecomment-2424899461","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98350","id":2424899461,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QiQeF","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-20T12:21:25Z","updated_at":"2024-10-21T09:38:00Z","body":"I was thinking about creating a seperate commit for documentations, after everyth